WEBVTT

39:03.124 --> 39:04.165
He has been chosen!

39:04.250 --> 39:05.875
-He must go.
-Hey!

39:05.960 --> 39:07.502
-What are you doing?
-Do not fight the claw.

39:07.586 --> 39:09.713
Stop it! Stop it, you zealots!

39:13.259 --> 39:16.011
All right!
Double prizes!

39:18.723 --> 39:21.307
Let's go home and... play.
